{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有。Y在S08把“暂时把回去的事放一边”进一步解释成“没因此想回头”，S09又把“想在难受时有人陪”推成“怕孤单到愿意再受那些气”，比X更替人物下了结论，削弱了一点原有的心理暧昧和摇摆。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的重点句有醒目的视觉抓手，完整叙事与随音乐出现的细小感受交替，观众更容易在听音乐时迅速找到当前段落的意思，而不是在一堆短词中自行拼凑。它反复强化“被当作自己人—害怕孤单—不愿再受委屈—带着想念继续生活”这条心理主线，前后联系更容易被普通观众捕捉；音乐感受也更具体，既有声音、节奏、舞步的变化，也有呼吸、身体和情绪的细微反应。主要代价是个别地方解释得过于确定，牺牲了X原本保留的一点复杂性。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5e2b2873-0c2a-42b9-99ef-4dbd33b623cc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T052745399688Z", "elapsed_seconds": 72.5, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T05:28:57.891905+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "323e1b417f8a0d47176a1d5cf48555da47e436882b760967348ab802d0bc6b8b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f